    6: { sharp: "I trusted {a}. Mostly. Hearing the word was still the best feeling.", dry: "I trusted {a}. Mostly. Hearing the word was still the best feeling of my life.", loud: "I TRUSTED {a}, MOSTLY! Hearing the WORD was STILL the BEST feeling of my LIFE!", soft: "I trusted {a}. Mostly. Hearing the word was still the best feeling of my life.", odd: "I trusted {a}. Ninety percent. The word made it a hundred." },
